  "_comment": [
    "Manifest for the KanjiVG stroke SVGs in data/strokes/ (controller §8).",
    "The SVG files are byte-identical, unmodified copies of upstream KanjiVG, including",
    "their in-file CC BY-SA 3.0 copyright header. They were fetched, never hand-drawn or",
    "generated: scripts/fetch-kanjivg.mjs downloads them from the pinned commit below and",
    "--check re-verifies them against upstream.",
    "test/strokes.test.ts re-hashes every file offline and re-derives strokeCount,",
    "components and radicals from the bytes, so data/kanji.json cannot drift from the",
    "stroke data it claims to be derived from."
